    "displayName": "Shiina",
    "text": "FINAL FANTASY 7 GAME DIRECTOR COMMENTS ON THE FORTNITE COLLAB DISCUSSION\n\n\"As for a potential collaboration with Fortnite, there is nothing I can share that would raise expectations at this time. However, I can say that Fortnite was certainly one of the titles that provided inspiration for the creation of FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION.\"\n\n(Spotted by @BackersGamesF)",
    "date": "2026-09-10T20:24:26+00:00",
    "url": "https://x.com/ShiinaBR/status/2098145595131146629",
    "images": [
      "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR4b4MiaYAACytA.png"
    ],
    "videos": []
  },
  {
    "id": "2098140238837174430",
    "username": "HYPEX",
    "displayName": "HYPEX",
    "text": "RT @nhamaguc: As we approach the launch of FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION, we are exploring collaborations with a variety of different IPs. Our collaboration with Street Fighter is one of the first steps in that effort.\nAs for a potential collaboration with Fortnite, there is nothing I can share that would raise expectations at this time. However, as a game creator, I can say that Fortnite was certainly one of the titles that provided inspiration for the creation of FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION.\n-\n\n『FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION』のローンチに向けて、私たちはさまざまなIPとのコラボレーションを模索しています。ストリートファイターとのコラボは、その最初の取り組みの一つです。\nフォートナイトとのコラボレーションについては、現時点で皆さんに期待していただけるようなお話はできません。ただ、ゲームクリエイターとして言えるのは、フォートナイトが『FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION』の創作に少なからずインスピレーションを与えてくれた作品であるということです。\n\n#FF7R",
    "date": "2026-09-10T20:03:09+00:00",
    "url": "https://x.com/HYPEX/status/2098140238837174430",
    "images": [],
    "videos": []
  },
