    "displayName": "Shiina",
    "text": "FORTNITE X FINAL FANTASY 7 - POTENTIAL FUTURE COLLAB\n\nThe game's director pointed out that Square Enix already has a partnership with Epic thanks to the Kingdom Hearts collab, and said they are currently considering several potential collabs, but didn't confirm if Fortnite is included in their options\n\n(Thanks to @Loolo_WRLD for the heads-up)",
