    "username": "HYPEX",
    "displayName": "HYPEX",
    "text": "FINAL FANTASY x FORTNITE IS LIKELY HAPPENING\n\nFF7 Director Naoki Hamaguchi says they're currently considering several collaborations, and when asked if Fortnite is one of them, he said it's \"something for the fans to look forward to\"\n\nHe also called the Fortnite team \"incredible and great partners to work with\" and said Square Enix already has a relationship with them through the Kingdom Hearts collab\n\nHamaguchi also said \"Barret\" would be his pick for Fortnite, and revealed that FF7 Revelation's Highwind parachuting mechanic was directly inspired by Fortnite\n\n[Noticed by @KBladeHero]",
